{"_note":"商店卡 · 展开态(48h 内有事件的 App;v40:截图格按真比例 —— 高 = {parent.h}-96,卡高 bh 由 watchlist.df 按该 App 截图类别算,此前 104pt 见方的格子把竖屏截图裁得只剩中间三分之一):icon + 名 + 星串 + 评分数 + 版本 chip + NEW + 截图条 + 说明摘要。字段由 XPage forEach 逐槽传入(n/ic/v/r/st/cf/d/nt/u1..u3)。截图走 imageResolver(同 icon,不过 netGuard);取不到图 = 一块圆角底,不是洞。整卡可点进详情。","rc":{"cells":[{"id":"bg2","type":"layer","x":"0pt","y":"0pt","w":"{parent.w}","h":"{parent.h}","bgColor":"#BFD9F5|#2A3D55","cornerRadius":{"leftT":"14pt","leftB":"14pt","rightT":"14pt","rightB":"14pt"}},{"id":"bg","type":"layer","x":"1.2pt","y":"1.2pt","w":"{parent.w}-2.4pt","h":"{parent.h}-2.4pt","bgColor":"#FFFFFF|#15171A","cornerRadius":{"leftT":"13pt","leftB":"13pt","rightT":"13pt","rightB":"13pt"}},{"id":"icon","type":"img","x":"14pt","y":"14pt","w":"38pt","h":"38pt","url":"${ic}","scaleType":"centerCrop","cornerRadius":{"leftT":"12pt","leftB":"12pt","rightT":"12pt","rightB":"12pt"},"bgColor":"#E7E9EE|#20232A"},{"id":"name","type":"txt","x":"62pt","y":"15pt","w":"{parent.w}-176pt","h":"-1","text":"$[findNotEmpty::(${n},--)]","fontSize":"13.5pt","typeface":"System-Bold","textColor":"#0E1116|#F3F4F6","maxLines":"1"},{"id":"stars","type":"txt","x":"62pt","y":"35pt","w":"76pt","h":"-1","text":"$[findNotEmpty::(${st},☆☆☆☆☆)]","fontSize":"10.5pt","textColor":"#0A7AFF|#4DA0FF","maxLines":"1"},{"id":"meta","type":"txt","x":"140pt","y":"36pt","w":"{parent.w}-256pt","h":"-1","text":"$[findNotEmpty::(${r},--)] · $[findNotEmpty::(${cf},--)]","fontSize":"10pt","textColor":"#6B7280|#8E939B","maxLines":"1"},{"type":"op","action":"if","props":{"val":"$[eq::(${nw},1)]"},"react":[{"id":"new","type":"txt","x":"{parent.w}-114pt","y":"18pt","w":"32pt","h":"-1","text":"NEW","fontSize":"9pt","typeface":"System-Bold","textColor":"#0A7AFF|#4DA0FF","maxLines":"1"}]},{"id":"verChip","type":"layer","x":"{parent.w}-78pt","y":"14pt","w":"64pt","h":"20pt","cornerRadius":{"leftT":"8pt","leftB":"8pt","rightT":"8pt","rightB":"8pt"},"bgColor":"#E7E9EE|#20232A"},{"type":"op","action":"if","props":{"val":